{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.14]Ugh, you're a monster\n[Verse 1: Eminem]\n[00:02.56]I can swallow a bottle of alcohol and I'll feel like Godzilla\n[00:06.44]Better hit the deck like the card dealer\n[00:08.60]My whole squad's in here, walking around the party\n[00:10.82]A cross between a zombie apocalypse and B-Bobby \"The\n[00:14.18]Brain\" Heenan which is probably the\n[00:15.64]Same reason I wrestle with mania\n[00:17.08]Shady's in this bitch, I'm posse'd up\n[00:18.54]Consider it to cross me a costly mistake\n[00:20.58]If they sleepin' on me, the hoes better get insomnia\n[00:23.28]ADHD, Hydroxycut\n[00:25.06]Pass the Courvoisier (Hey, hey)\n[00:27.08]In AA with an AK, melee, finna set it like a playdate\n[00:29.56]Better vacate, retreat like a vacay, mayday (Ayy)\n[00:31.92]This beat is cray-cray, Ray J, H-A-H-A-H-A\n[00:34.46]Laughing all the way to the bank, I spray flames\n[00:36.08]They cannot tame or placate the\n[00:37.16][Chorus: Juice WRLD\n[00:37.54]& Eminem\n[00:37.72]]\n[00:37.78]Monster\n[00:37.94]You get in my way, I'ma feed you to the monster (Yeah)\n[00:40.64]I'm normal during the day, but at night, turn to a monster (Yeah)\n[00:43.68]When the moon shines like Ice Road Truckers\n[00:45.50]I look like a villain outta those blockbusters\n[00:47.08]Godzilla, fire spitter\n[00:47.60], monster\n[00:47.92]Blood on the dance floor, and on the Louis V carpet\n[00:50.16]Fire, Godzilla, fire\n[00:50.78], monster\n[00:51.64]Blood on the dance floor, and on the Louis V carpet\n[Verse 2: Eminem]\n[00:56.02]I'm just a product of Slick Rick and Onyx, told 'em lick the balls\n[01:02.18]Had 'em just appalled, did so many things that pissed 'em off\n[01:04.52]It's impossible to list 'em all\n[01:06.04]And in the midst of all this\n[01:07.04]I'm in a mental hospital with a crystal ball\n[01:08.76]Tryna see, will I still be like this tomorrow?\n[01:10.24]Risperdal, voices whisper\n[01:11.46]My fist is balled back up against the wall, pencil drawn\n[01:13.70]This is just the song to go ballistic on\n[01:15.50]You just pulled a pistol on the guy with a missile launcher\n[01:17.92]I'm just a Loch Ness, the mythological\n[01:19.80]Quick to tell a bitch screw off like a fifth of vodka\n[01:21.94]When you twist the top of the bottle, I'm a\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Eminem]\n[01:23.44]Monster\n[01:24.20]You get in my way, I'ma feed you to the monster (Yeah)\n[01:26.92]I'm normal during the day, but at night, turn to a monster (Yeah)\n[01:29.96]When the moon shines like Ice Road Truckers\n[01:33.50]I look like a villain outta those blockbusters\n[01:35.96]Godzilla, fire spitter\n[01:37.06], monster\n[01:39.36]Blood on the dance floor, and on the Louis V carpet\n[01:41.52]Fire, Godzilla, fire\n[01:42.30], monster\n[01:42.54]Blood on the dance floor, and on the Louis V carpet\n[Verse 3: Eminem]\n[01:45.52]If you never gave a damn (Ayy), raise your hand\n[01:48.30]'Cause I'm about to set trip, vacation plans\n[01:51.36]I'm on point like my index is, so all you will ever get is\n[01:54.50]The motherfuckin' finger (Finger), prostate exam ('Xam)\n[01:57.26]How can I have all these fans and perspire?\n[01:59.00]Like a liar's pants, I'm on fire\n[02:00.46]And I got no plans to retire and I'm still the man you admire\n[02:03.34]These chicks are spazzin' out, I only get more handsome and flyer\n[02:06.36]I got 'em passin' out like what you do when you hand someone flyers\n[02:09.14]And what goes around comes around just like the blades on the chainsaw\n[02:11.92]'Cause I caught the flack, but my dollars stacked right off the bat like a baseball\n[02:14.92]Like Kid Ink, bitch, I got them racks with so much ease that they call me Diddy\n[02:18.12]'Cause I make bands and I call getting cheese a cakewalk (Cheesecake, yeah)\n[02:21.60]Bitch, I'm a player, I'm too motherfuckin' stingy for Cher\n[02:23.78]Won't even lend you an ear, ain't even pretending to care\n[02:25.90]But I tell a bitch I'll marry her if she'll bury her\n[02:27.52]Face in my genital area, the original Richard Ramirez\n[02:29.84]Cristhian Rivera, 'cause my lyrics never sit well\n[02:31.64]So they wanna give me the chair\n[02:32.80]Like a paraplegic, and it's scary, call it Hari Kari\n[02:34.96]'Cause e'ry Tom and Dick and Harry carry a Merriam motherfuckin' dictionary on 'em\n[02:38.14]Swearing up and down they can spit, this shit's hilarious\n[02:39.92]It's time to put these bitches in the obituary column\n[02:41.90]We wouldn't see eye to eye with a staring problem\n[02:43.46]Get the shaft like a steering column (\n[02:45.22]Monster\n[02:45.40])\n[02:45.46]Trigger happy, pack heat, but it's black ink\n[02:46.98]Evil half of the Bad Meets\n[02:47.90]Evil, that means take a back seat\n[02:48.90]Take it back to Fat Beats with a maxi single\n[02:50.54]Look at my rap sheet, what attracts these people\n[02:52.04]Is my 'Gangsta Bitch' like Apache with a catchy jingle\n[02:54.22]I stack chips, you barely got a half-eaten Cheeto\n[02:57.38]Fill 'em with the venom and eliminate 'em\n[02:58.54]Other words, I Minute Maid 'em\n[02:59.22]I don't wanna hurt 'em, but I did, I'm in a fit of rage\n[03:00.58]I'm murderin' again, nobody will evade\n[03:01.64]I'm finna kill 'em and dump all their fuckin' bodies in the lake\n[03:03.12]Obliterating everything, incinerate and renegade 'em\n[03:04.62]Here to make anybody who want it with the pen afraid\n[03:06.02]But don't nobody want it, but they're gonna get it anyway\n[03:07.44]'Cause I'm beginnin' to feel like I'm mentally ill\n[03:08.64]I'm Attila, kill or be killed, I'm a killer bee, the vanilla gorilla\n[03:10.38]You're bringin' the killer within me outta me\n[03:11.52]You don't wanna be the enemy of the demon who entered me\n[03:13.08]And be on the receivin' end of me, what stupidity it'd be\n[03:14.70]Every bit of me's the epitome of a spitter\n[03:15.94]When I'm in the vicinity, motherfucker, you better duck\n[03:17.42]Or you finna be dead the minute you run into me\n[03:18.66]A hundred percent of you is a fifth of a percent of me\n[03:20.08]I'm 'bout to fuckin' finish you, bitch, I'm unfadable\n[03:21.38]You wanna battle, I'm available, I'm blowin' up like an inflatable\n[03:23.18]I'm undebatable, I'm unavoidable, I'm unevadable\n[03:24.82]I'm on the toilet bowl, I got a trailer full of money and I'm paid in full\n[03:26.64]I'm not afraid to pull a—\n[Outro: Eminem]\n[03:27.56]Man, stop\n[03:28.92]Look what I'm plannin', haha","words":[[0.14,0.74,"Ugh,"],[0.78,1.0,"you're"],[1.06,1.06,"a"],[1.32,1.92,"monster"],[2.56,2.56,"I"],[2.62,2.72,"can"],[2.78,3.2,"swallow"],[3.24,3.24,"a"],[3.56,3.92,"bottle"],[3.96,3.98,"of"],[4.32,4.86,"alcohol"],[4.92,4.98,"and"],[5.02,5.1,"I'll"],[5.32,5.48,"feel"],[5.54,5.66,"like"],[5.7,6.14,"Godzilla"],[6.44,6.6,"Better"],[6.66,6.76,"hit"],[6.82,6.86,"the"],[6.98,7.12,"deck"],[7.18,7.3,"like"],[7.34,7.38,"the"],[7.5,7.76,"card"],[7.82,8.02,"dealer"],[8.6,8.72,"My"],[8.78,8.88,"whole"],[8.92,9.24,"squad's"],[9.28,9.32,"in"],[9.36,9.48,"here,"],[9.52,9.9,"walking"],[9.98,10.26,"around"],[10.3,10.34,"the"],[10.42,10.74,"party"],[10.82,10.82,"A"],[10.96,11.24,"cross"],[11.32,11.64,"between"],[11.74,11.74,"a"],[11.84,12.24,"zombie"],[12.28,13.0,"apocalypse"],[13.04,13.14,"and"],[13.24,13.64,"B-Bobby"],[13.7,13.74,"\"The"],[14.18,14.32,"Brain\""],[14.42,14.66,"Heenan"],[14.74,14.88,"which"],[14.94,15.0,"is"],[15.08,15.44,"probably"],[15.5,15.54,"the"],[15.64,15.82,"Same"],[15.88,16.1,"reason"],[16.22,16.22,"I"],[16.32,16.52,"wrestle"],[16.6,16.7,"with"],[16.74,17.0,"mania"],[17.08,17.26,"Shady's"],[17.48,17.52,"in"],[17.56,17.62,"this"],[17.66,17.8,"bitch,"],[17.86,17.92,"I'm"],[17.98,18.38,"posse'd"],[18.42,18.46,"up"],[18.54,18.9,"Consider"],[18.94,18.98,"it"],[19.08,19.14,"to"],[19.24,19.4,"cross"],[19.48,19.52,"me"],[19.66,19.66,"a"],[19.8,20.12,"costly"],[20.2,20.52,"mistake"],[20.58,20.64,"If"],[20.7,20.8,"they"],[20.86,21.18,"sleepin'"],[21.32,21.34,"on"],[21.54,21.56,"me,"],[21.62,21.66,"the"],[21.98,22.12,"hoes"],[22.16,22.3,"better"],